{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016223440209-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016224135\"/><p>石排灣邨碧山樓有人吊頸。</p><p>今日(16日)傍晚6時09分，香港仔石排灣邨碧山樓一單位，姓朱(62歲)男子被家人發現上吊，並把其解下。救援人員接報到場，發現朱男倒臥房間內，並且陷入昏迷，被送往瑪麗醫院經搶救後證實死亡。經初步調查後，相信他以一條皮帶上吊，現場沒有檢獲遺書，其尋短原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:59:03.610226+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:34:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:57:45.760481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:57:37.762180+00:00","content_hash":"84d539b11e18c1620ca52703c37237b4dca53fce221052d0849deed258c79de6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}